-    labeldrop, labelkeep, uppercase, lowercase, graphite. keep_metrics/drop_metrics are accepted
-    at parse time and rewritten internally to keep/drop against the __name__ label.
+    labeldrop, labelkeep, uppercase, lowercase, trim, graphite. keep_metrics/drop_metrics are
+    accepted at parse time and rewritten internally to keep/drop against the __name__ label.
+    trim mirrors uppercase/lowercase: it requires source labels and a target label, joins the
+    source label values with the configured separator, strips leading/trailing whitespace, and
+    stores the result at the target label.
 
 Annotations: |
   This cell is a pure, side-effect-free label-transformation engine implementing Prometheus
